WEBVTT

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.640
that train to crossing, it'll cut us off.

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:32.990
Thank you.

00:03:01.460 --> 00:03:03.740
Can't explain this to the cop. Let's get out of here.

00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:05.030
That's my partner's car.

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:06.900
He was surely killed.

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:08.900
Yeah, it looks like that to me.

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:10.590
Let's look over there for it.

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:22.480
family.

00:04:24.440 --> 00:04:25.460
I badly hurt Vandela.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:27.510
Get me to a doctor quick.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:30.000
Give me your name and address. I'll explain this to the truck.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.520
and see you fellas about this later.

00:04:31.640 --> 00:04:32.120
My God.

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:33.130
Okay.

00:04:34.150 --> 00:04:34.730
On your way.

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:49.400
Stanfield sure tough to survive that smash-up.

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:50.360
Well, we've got to get him.

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:51.320
Snap into it.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:10.640
Get that, Dr. Vandor, and let's go on to your beach place.

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:12.270
but you're badly hurt.

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:14.080
I was just tricked to fool that cop.

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:14.630
Thank you.

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:17.270
That cop evidently frightened away those crooks.

00:05:18.010 --> 00:05:19.250
I bet they didn't go very far.

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:31.480
There's a car speeding up on us.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:32.160
Who left?

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:53.150
away from us.

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:01.740
Thank you.

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:37.860
Well, you lost them.

00:06:38.020 --> 00:06:40.310
Yes, but we haven't lost your bonds.

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:41.740
They're right here in my pocket.

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:43.890
Well, what do you think of the place?

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:47.010
Say, this is a wonderful hideout.

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:49.500
And just a place for our scientific experiments.

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:54.380
And the advantage is that nobody knows of this precluded spot.

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:05.290
Neither the law nor Barnett can find you here.

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:08.490
until we're ready to meet that trumped-up murder charge.

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:09.370
Oh, that's fine.

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:11.480
I don't know how I'll ever be able to repay you.

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:13.260
You have already repaid me.

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:15.840
If it hadn't been for you a part in our plans.

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:17.890
the vanishing ray wouldn't have been possible.

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:19.910
Professor, you're too kind.

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:20.510
Come inside.

00:07:20.980 --> 00:07:21.540
We look at all.

00:07:34.060 --> 00:07:34.460
Thank you.

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:37.320
Thank you.

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:37.980
Thank you.

00:07:43.430 --> 00:07:43.850
Great, sir.

00:07:44.780 --> 00:07:46.120
Stanfield outsmarted you.

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:47.500
Well, find him.

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:48.750
And bend on.

00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:50.400
Men don't vanish into thin air.

00:07:51.020 --> 00:07:53.820
And I don't want any more cock and bull stories about any vanishing shadow.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:56.800
Yeah.

00:07:59.240 --> 00:07:59.980
There's a young lady.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:00.780
Happy to see you, sir.

00:08:00.900 --> 00:08:01.360
What's her name?

00:08:01.690 --> 00:08:02.310
She wouldn't say.

00:08:02.390 --> 00:08:02.810
Wouldn't say.

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:03.430
Send her away.

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:04.780
Yes, sir.

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:05.760
Wait a minute.

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:22.260
Come here.

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:23.440
Yes, sir.

00:08:26.390 --> 00:08:27.530
Will you come this way, miss?

00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:36.760
Would you be seated?

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:44.170
So, Miss Gloria Grant, eh?

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:48.520
It has taken you ten years to come to your senses and recognize your father.

00:08:49.030 --> 00:08:51.470
The poison of hatred instilled into you by your mother must have...

00:08:51.470 --> 00:08:52.930
We'll leave mother's name out of this, please.

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:55.380
I'm not making a social call.

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:56.600
Father.

00:08:56.940 --> 00:08:57.340
Oh.

00:08:57.700 --> 00:08:59.920
still reluctant to acknowledge the relationship, eh?

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:00.980
Thank you.

00:09:01.300 --> 00:09:02.080
What brings you here?

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:05.340
An interview for your paper, The Tribune, I suppose.

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:07.370
My business concerns a young man.

00:09:07.470 --> 00:09:08.730
The young man I saw you with two days ago?

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:10.260
Stanley Stanfield.

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:11.720
Yeah, well, the police will take care of him.

00:09:13.370 --> 00:09:14.750
Mr. Cadwell is here, sir.

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:16.230
He says it's very important.

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:16.980
Padwell.

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:18.440
Alive.

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:20.720
Got him to wait.

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:21.330
Yes, sir.

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:24.860
You have important visits, Father.

00:09:25.020 --> 00:09:25.440
I'll let alone.

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:25.980
Just a minute.

00:09:28.180 --> 00:09:29.240
What did you come here for?

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:32.460
I got what I came for.

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:33.180
Listen, Gloria.

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:36.940
If you interfere with my plans, I forget you're my daughter and...

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:39.060
Use the same methods with me you used with my mother?

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:45.820
Oh, Miss Bonnet, I...

00:09:45.820 --> 00:09:46.160
Get inside.

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:49.320
Who's downstairs?

00:09:50.630 --> 00:09:51.650
Badger and Kent, sir.

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:54.280
Tell him to follow that young lady and give me a full report at once.

00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:55.300
Very good, sir.

00:09:59.240 --> 00:09:59.840
Listen, badger.

00:10:00.470 --> 00:10:02.150
There's a young lady coming down at the elevator.

00:10:02.940 --> 00:10:03.500
You know, please.

00:10:04.020 --> 00:10:04.400
Eh, heh.

00:10:04.890 --> 00:10:05.610
Check it tight.

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:07.020
Brown shoes.

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:10.840
Cadwell, we'll have to forget about Stanfield's bonds and everything else.

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:16.260
And concentrate on getting his tribune stock so that I'll be prepared to vote it within ten days in order to get control of the paper.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:17.740
The Board of Directors...

00:10:17.740 --> 00:10:18.160
Yes, I know.

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:21.760
If we don't find Stanfield, I could fix you up some proxies.

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:23.780
Of course, you'd be taking a pretty big risk.

00:10:25.340 --> 00:10:26.040
Here she comes.

00:10:32.970 --> 00:10:36.310
Even with the stock in your possession, you'd have to figure a way to get Stanfield's signature.

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:37.750
Well, forget about the proxies.

00:10:38.060 --> 00:10:38.840
Find Stanfield.

00:10:39.210 --> 00:10:40.090
I know how to get his signature.

00:10:40.310 --> 00:10:41.850
But, Mr. Barnett, you wouldn't...

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:42.570
Find him, I tell you.

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:44.900
Put every available man on the job.

00:10:55.660 --> 00:10:55.880
now

00:11:04.990 --> 00:11:05.950
Let's put on your coat.

00:11:19.060 --> 00:11:19.900
Doctor is showing.

00:11:20.670 --> 00:11:21.530
What do we do with it?

00:11:22.260 --> 00:11:23.440
Well, we'll tuck it in here.

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:26.520
We can adjust it later.

00:11:28.110 --> 00:11:28.410
There.

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:29.930
Now you can walk.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.580
Into any room, I'll be conspicuous by my absence.

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:32.990
Thank you.

00:11:33.260 --> 00:11:33.500
Thank you.

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:35.790
Try it out.

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:50.890
about the shadow.

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:52.400
Move down the room.

00:11:58.060 --> 00:11:58.320
No.

00:11:58.920 --> 00:11:59.540
Still shows.

00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:10.100
The shadow is merely a question of getting the right way, Frank.

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:14.530
Yes, once we have that completed,

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:18.490
we have the power in our hands to break Wade Barnett and that whole gang.

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:22.560
We'll be present at every secret meeting they hold.

00:12:22.980 --> 00:12:27.420
To the tribune behind us, we can bring every one of those men within reach of the law.

00:12:27.830 --> 00:12:28.330
The law?

00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:29.960
You and I?

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:30.860
I will be the law.

00:12:31.570 --> 00:12:33.020
Judge, jury.

00:12:57.060 --> 00:12:57.480
What next?

00:12:58.210 --> 00:12:59.510
We've got to make a full report.

00:13:00.220 --> 00:13:02.660
Barnett thinks she knows where Stanfield is.

00:13:03.620 --> 00:13:04.040
Let's go.

00:13:18.640 --> 00:13:19.920
Surfside, 7-1-1.

00:13:25.310 --> 00:13:26.050
This is Miss Grant.

00:13:26.090 --> 00:13:27.490
May I speak to Mr. Stanfield, please?

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:28.980
Stanfield?

00:13:30.220 --> 00:13:30.740
It's Miss Grant.

00:13:31.110 --> 00:13:32.810
Oh, are you sure you can trust her?

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:33.310
Oh, absolutely.

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:36.120
Besides, she'll have important news for me.

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:37.420
Hello, Miss Grant.

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:41.190
Oh, Mr. Stanfield, I have glorious news for you.

00:13:41.650 --> 00:13:43.930
Mr. Cadwell was not killed with that shot.

00:13:44.450 --> 00:13:45.050
He's alive.

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:48.040
I saw him less than an hour ago at Mr. Barnett's office.

00:13:48.980 --> 00:13:49.620
Cadwell's alive.

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:51.200
Alive.

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:54.680
Then it was a trick to get your tribune to stop.

00:13:54.860 --> 00:13:55.040
Wait a minute.

00:13:56.510 --> 00:13:58.030
That's certainly great news, Miss Grant.

00:13:59.020 --> 00:13:59.980
Well, now that I know the police...

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.920
If the police aren't after me, I'll come right over and see you.

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:04.750
Take a little walk and talk things over.

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:09.420
You're safe from the law, but remember, your enemies are outside the law.

00:14:10.210 --> 00:14:11.930
Better not come in daylight. Wait until evening.

00:14:12.570 --> 00:14:14.590
That's fine. See you at eight tonight.

00:14:15.010 --> 00:14:16.370
Hide somewhere and watch this place.

00:14:18.130 --> 00:14:18.930
I phone Barnett.

00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:25.160
Bye.

00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:26.540
Goodbye.

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:28.460
I'm clear.

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:29.980
Ms. Grant, set yourself up.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:32.460
Catwell alive in Barnett's office less than an hour ago.

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:33.650
In Barnett's office?

00:14:34.910 --> 00:14:36.010
What was she doing there?

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:38.040
Well, I don't know.

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:40.320
Professor Julie, you don't suspect her?

00:14:41.260 --> 00:14:41.680
Oh, no.

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:43.660
I just wondered.

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:47.090
I was about to demonstrate my destroying ray.

00:14:48.460 --> 00:14:49.460
Now, you see that flower?

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:53.290
It lives just like other living things.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:12.620
Why, it's completely destroyed.

00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:14.780
See, the plot remains.

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:18.250
My destroying ray attacks only living cells.

00:15:19.300 --> 00:15:21.160
Now, if a man had stood there...

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:28.930
Professor, why do you use a brain, an intellect like yours, to invent agencies of destruction?

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:29.980
Ah, but...

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.100
But think what it would mean to an army.

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:33.520
Our army.

00:15:34.860 --> 00:15:36.760
It would save while it destroyed.

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:38.440
I know, but why don't you think of...

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:39.740
You were about to see Miss Grant.

00:15:40.530 --> 00:15:44.680
Take this along, and if you should meet your enemies, they're at your mercy.

00:15:45.220 --> 00:15:46.610
Oh, no thanks, Professor.

00:15:46.970 --> 00:15:49.260
I know what it is to be wanted for murder.

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:51.710
But explain it to me.

00:15:51.810 --> 00:15:52.230
Gladly.

00:15:57.300 --> 00:15:58.800
Learn where Stanfield is hiding?

00:15:59.230 --> 00:15:59.590
No.

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:02.320
I'll learn Stanfield will be at that girl's house.

00:16:02.650 --> 00:16:03.470
8 o'clock tonight.

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:05.120
All right, Kent, you stay where you are.

00:16:05.430 --> 00:16:06.450
I'm sending Dorgan to meet you.

00:16:08.430 --> 00:16:10.170
Stanfield will be at that girl's house at 8 o'clock tonight.

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:11.310
Who is the lady?

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:12.360
Never mind.

00:16:13.370 --> 00:16:14.870
And don't forget, she is not to be harmed.

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:17.180
You'll take a woman with you and...

00:16:21.300 --> 00:16:22.760
I insist I'm going with me.

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:24.780
Because I need you.

00:16:25.590 --> 00:16:27.130
I don't want you to fall into a trap.

00:16:28.390 --> 00:16:29.290
All right, let's go.

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:32.760
When you were starting the car, I'll lock this up.

00:16:33.100 --> 00:16:36.000
That's a good idea. That's much too dangerous to be lying around.

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:37.860
Hold on, be long.

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:53.880
Thank you.

00:17:03.510 --> 00:17:04.490
Thank you.

00:17:27.030 --> 00:17:27.390
Jones.

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:29.190
We've made a mistake.

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:31.390
No mistake, miss.

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:34.190
We've got business with your friend Stanfield.

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:35.770
If you don't mind, we'll just wait.

00:17:36.010 --> 00:17:39.190
And the quieter you keep, the better it'll be for both you and Stanfield.

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:45.490
Thank you.

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:47.160
See you later!

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:48.520
The phone's not working, miss.

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:49.880
We took care of that.

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:54.820
Stanfield you want. He isn't here.

00:17:55.210 --> 00:17:55.890
But it will be.

00:17:56.460 --> 00:17:57.380
And we're willing to wait.

00:17:58.920 --> 00:17:59.660
Take her over there.

00:18:00.570 --> 00:18:00.950
Come on.

00:18:02.460 --> 00:18:03.960
Put out some of these lights, Kent.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:30.340
Come on in.

00:18:30.760 --> 00:18:31.200
Thank you.

00:18:41.190 --> 00:18:42.510
We've been waiting for you, Stanfield.

00:18:43.660 --> 00:18:43.960
trap.

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:45.120
I was afraid of that.

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:47.080
Get in there where we can look you over.

00:18:49.450 --> 00:18:51.370
You better come along quietly, Stanfield.

00:18:53.510 --> 00:18:54.990
Well, you have the best of us, I guess.

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:56.390
All we can do is go.

00:19:18.070 --> 00:19:18.650
You're a sinner.

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:24.040
I'm talking.

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:25.820
Devil's trying to...

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:27.170
Kill me with this internal machine.

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:32.480
Turn it off, Bandon. You'll destroy us all.

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:33.280
Thank you.

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:45.770
Stand on.
